# Web Frontend Conventions

Follow the golden file pattern — see [`docs/golden-file-pattern.md`](../../docs/golden-file-pattern.md) and the `golden-file-pattern` rule.

## Folder structure

```
src/
  pages/              # route pages (compose features, no business rules)
  features/<domain>/  # product features
    feature-name.tsx           # public export → container
    containers/                # one hook, one view, bind only
    hooks/                     # queries, stores, view models, handlers
    *-view.tsx                 # presentational only
    stores/                    # mutations & optimistic orchestration
  features/shared/    # agency queries, live sync, query cache, agency-ui
  ui/                 # shadcn primitives
  lib/                # shared infrastructure only (orpc, env, utils)
```

## Data fetching

**TanStack Query** via `orpc` utils — never hand-roll cache keys:

```tsx
import { useQuery } from "@tanstack/react-query";
import { orpc } from "@/lib/orpc";

const { data } = useQuery(
  orpc.agencyOps.clients.list.queryOptions({ input: { teamId } }),
);
```

Shared agency queries live in `features/shared/agency-queries.ts`. Feature-specific fetching stays in feature hooks unless shared boot/live/optimistic behavior is needed.

**Zustand** for mutations and optimistic orchestration — call `orpcClient` from feature stores, patch via `features/shared/agency-query-cache.ts`.

Views and containers do **not** import oRPC, TanStack Query, or stores.

## Styling

- `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for all class merging
- `cva()` only inside `ui/*` (shadcn primitives)
- Semantic tokens: `text-muted`, `bg-background`, `text-primary` — never raw gray classes
- Follow [DESIGN.md](../../DESIGN.md): flat UI, hairline borders, no gradients/glassmorphism

## Forms

```tsx
import { useForm } from "react-hook-form";
import { zodResolver } from "@hookform/resolvers/zod";
import { loginSchema } from "@/features/auth/auth-schemas";
```

Feature schemas live in the feature folder or `lib/schemas/` for cross-cutting auth. Use shadcn `Form*` from `ui/`.

## Routing

- Pages in `src/pages/`, lazy-loaded in `app.tsx`
- Protected routes in `authenticated-routes.tsx` behind `ProtectedRoute`
- App-local imports use `@/` alias
